    "description": "Cote D Azur Watch Lot! Quartz Wristwatch Dial, Pen, Business Card Holder\nBrand\n: Cote d' Azur\nColor\n: Silver/Gold/Black\nDepartment\n: Men's Watches\nCategory\n: Jewelry & Watches\nMaterial\n: Stainless Steel\nCondition\n: Good: Minor visible imperfections\nFunctionality\n: Operational - May require adjustment to provide accurate time keeping.\nPick-ups\n: If you do not pick up your orders within 14 days from payment your items will be considered a donation and refunds will not be issued.\nDescription\n: Elevate your style with this elegant Cote d' Azur gift set, perfect for the modern gentleman. The centerpiece is a refined men's wristwatch, featuring a striking silver and gold-tone stainless steel band and a sophisticated black dial with calendar subdials. The watch's stainless steel caseback ensures lasting durability, while quartz movement delivers reliable timekeeping.\nComplementing the timepiece, the set includes a classic black ballpoint pen with metallic accents, ideal for both professional and personal use. Rounding out the set is a sleek black business card holder, crafted for practicality and a polished look, keeping your essentials organized and accessible. Delivered in a stylish branded box, this versatile trio blends luxury and value, making it an excellent gift or a smart everyday upgrade. Authentic Cote d' Azur quality ensures long-lasting satisfaction with every component. Enjoy the assurance of an authentic, quality product.\nJEWELRY INFORMATION\n-Gold and silver is tested with a Thermo Scientific Niton DXL x-ray machine.\n-Gemstone sizes are approximate, we try to measure accurately, please refer to photo for details.\n-Gemstones are measured with a Presidium Duo II and does not distinguish between natural and synthetic gems and/or materials.\n-Items are total weight. Some jewelry pieces may have attached pins, clasps, chains, or accent parts that are not precious metals included in this weight.\n-Displays used to stage product are not included in purchase.-Pocket watches may read gold on the Niton DXL x-ray machine but may in fact be gold filled or gold plated.\nUSED ITEMS DISCLAIMER:\nPlease note that all items have been donated. All items are used and untested (including battery life & functionality), lots are unsorted, unless otherwise noted. We do our best to ensure the quality of all our auctions & describe them accurately; however, we are not experts in any field. Items may contain unseen flaws or unknown missing parts not noted in the description.\nAll items are sold AS IS.\nIf you need further information about an item, please contact us prior to the close of the auction.\nTERMS OF SALE:\nOrders must be paid for within seven (7) days from the close of auction. All orders not paid within ten (10) days from the close of auction will be relisted for auction without further notice. Displays used to stage product are not included in purchase. Auctions cannot be combined if listed as such under Shipping tab.\nAUTHENTICATION:\nWe do not authenticate or appraise auction items, unless otherwise indicated in auction description or photographs.",
